{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6f8fea3c-b34b-8b8d-bca6-6248428fd134",
  "created_at": "2026-03-02T11:41:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Peter Hazard",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:38:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:38:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good morning. I'm calling about a crosswalk, the paint's faded almost completely, and cars just don't stop for people anymore. They roll right through."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:38:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a faded crosswalk. Where is that at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:38:57-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 342 Farewell Street, in the North End. Right in front of the house, basically. And it's, um, it's right in the bike lane too, so you've got bikes coming through and the cars aren't looking for either one, and I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:39:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:39:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, no, hang on. [pause] Put that down, please. Sorry, I'm back. Yeah, the bike lane runs right through where the crosswalk is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:39:24-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So 342 Farewell, crosswalk markings worn off, crosses the bike lane, and drivers aren't yielding. Is it a marked crosswalk on both sides of the street, or just the one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:39:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both sides, I think. The lines on my side are the worst. You can barely see the stripes, it looks like, like a smudge, honestly. And the, um..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:39:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:39:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry. Kid wants a snack. Yeah, so, just the faded paint, there's no pothole or anything there. It's only the markings."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:39:57-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's good to know. I'll put it in as a repainting request for the crosswalk and send it over to the crew that handles the striping. Can I get a callback number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:40:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:40:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-seven. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:40:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Peter Hazard. H-A-Z-A-R-D."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:40:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Peter. Let me finish typing this up. Crosswalk, faded, bike lane, 342 Farewell. There we go, it's in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:40:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Can I get a reference number for it? So I can say something if I call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:40:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. It's going to be PW, dash, three-one-eight-four-two. Want me to read that again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:40:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes please, let me grab a pen. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:40:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "P-W, dash, three, one, eight, four, two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:40:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, three-one-eight-four-two. Thanks. You know, I used to dread making phone calls like this, but I'm getting kind of used to them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:40:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, you're doing fine. The striping crew will take a look, and if they need anything they'll call that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:41:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:41:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now, Peter. Take care."
    }
  ],
